n over 100 real-world open-source libraries over the span of a few weeks.</p></div><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-body\" data-inactive=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\"><header class=\"nUeDbq_header _5NNTzG_carousel-info-meta\"><div class=\"nUeDbq_headerButton\"><button aria-label=\"Related to Claude reveals ECDSA curve origins\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_f99l9qnpfcnpfkq6btb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/frontier-red-team\">Frontier Red Team</a></p><time class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-date\">Oct 16, 2026</time></header><a class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-link\" href=\"/research/ecdsa-curve-origins\"><h2 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-5 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-title\" data-component=\"Headline\">Claude reveals ECDSA curve origins</h2></a><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-4 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-description\" data-component=\"Body\">The decades-old mystery of the origins of one of the most popular cryptographic standards has been explained.</p></div><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-body\" data-inactive=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\"><header class=\"nUeDbq_header _5NNTzG_carousel-info-meta\"><div class=\"nUeDbq_headerButton\"><button aria-label=\"Related to Launching an opt-in vulnerability-finding service for open-source software\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_f9dl9qnpfcnpfkq6btb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-close\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zBq_icon hN4zBq_icon-visible\" width=\"12\" height=\"2\"><use href=\"#tiny-more-button-more\"></use></svg></button></div><p><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/research/team/frontier-red-team\">Frontier Red Team</a></p><time class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-date\">Oct 8, 2026</time></header><a class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-link\" href=\"/research/launching-opt-in-vuln-finding-service-for-open-source\"><h2 class=\"tOQyXa_headline-5 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-title\" data-component=\"Headline\">Launching an opt-in vulnerability-finding service for open-source software</h2></a><p class=\"tOQyXa_body-4 _5NNTzG_carousel-info-description\" data-component=\"Body\">We’re making available OSS Scanner, an opt-in vulnerability scanner for the open-source ecosystem that’s informed by our experience using Claude to find vulnerabilities during Project Glasswing.</p><a href=\"/research/launching-opt-in-vuln-finding-service-for-open-source\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-secondary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-trailing _5NNTzG_carousel-info-cta\">Read more<span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg class=\"lqbdHG_icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 21 21\"><path d=\"M4.14585 9.87492L14.4584 9.87492L9.60419 5.04158L10.5 4.14575L16.8542 10.4999L10.5 16.8541L9.60419 15.9583L14.4584 11.1249L4.14585 11.1249L4.14585 9.87492Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"_5NNTzG_carousel-info-body\" data-inactive=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\"><header class=\"nUeDbq_header _5NNTzG_carousel-info-meta\"><div class=\"nUeDbq_headerButton\"><button aria-label=\"Related to GLM-5.3 and the spread of advanced cyber capabilities\" class=\"hN4zBq_tiny-more-button hN4zBq_state-closed\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-base-ui-click-trigger=\"\" id=\"base-ui-_R_f9hl9qnpfcnpfkq6btb_\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hN4zB